.TH QUERENCIA-SCHNATTER 1 "October 2026" "querencia-schnatter 0.3.1" "Querencia Desktop"
.SH NAME
querencia-schnatter \- WhatsApp Web in its own window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B querencia-schnatter
.RI [ GTK-OPTION ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B querencia-schnatter
(Schnatter) shows WhatsApp Web in a window of its own, with the classic menu
bar of Querencia Desktop (File, Edit, View, Help). It is not a product of
WhatsApp or Meta and is not affiliated with them.
.PP
The sign-in is kept in
.I ~/.local/share/querencia-schnatter
and
.IR ~/.cache/querencia-schnatter ,
the settings in
.IR ~/.config/querencia-schnatter/einstellungen.ini .
File \(-> Log Out and Delete Data removes the stored data after a question.
.PP
A second start brings the open window to the front (one GTK application
with the ID
.BR org.querencia.Schnatter ).
Calls are not possible: the web engine of Ubuntu is built without WebRTC.
.SH MOVING FROM QUERENCIA WEB WRAPPER AND QUERENCIA MESSAGES
Version 0.2.0 was called Querencia Web Wrapper
.RB ( querencia-webhuelle ),
versions up to 0.1.1 Querencia Messages
.RB ( querencia-nachrichten ).
On its first start Schnatter renames the folders
.I querencia-webhuelle
\(en or, if 0.2.0 was skipped,
.I querencia-nachrichten
\(en in
.IR ~/.local/share ,
.I ~/.cache
and
.I ~/.config
to
.IR querencia-schnatter ;
nothing is copied or deleted, so the sign-in stays. While one of the old
programs is still running, Schnatter only says so and does not start. If a
folder of the new name exists already, the old ones are left untouched.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Ctrl+R, F5
reload
.TP
.B Ctrl+Plus, Ctrl+Minus, Ctrl+0
zoom in, zoom out, normal size (remembered)
.TP
.B F11
full screen
.TP
.B F1
help
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
quit
.SH SEE ALSO
https://querencialinux.org
